{"id":403701001,"chapter_id":70046,"scene_id":74601,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"<color=#FDF9BA><i>在永恒的黄金玫瑰之下\n\n你需在此起誓</color>","style":14,"background":10002,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"呃！！！","style":14,"background":10002,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"？？？","content":"是，我承诺。","voice":["vo_event_403703201_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37032","style":1,"background":10002,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"<color=#FDF9BA><i>你是否愿意在此发誓\n\n你会尽己所能，延续伟大先辈们的指引\n\n绝不负自己肩上的荣光？</i></color>","style":14,"background":10002,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"？？？","content":"是，我会恪守自己的言行，不忘心中的仁慈与正义。","voice":["vo_event_403703201_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37032","style":1,"background":10002,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"<color=#FDF9BA><i>最后，你是否会在黄金玫瑰的见证下宣誓\n\n不论艰难，不惜代价\n\n永不背弃责任，永不辜负誓言？</i></color>","style":14,"background":10002,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"<color=#FDF9BA><i>即使……</i></color>","style":14,"background":10002,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"content":"<i><color=#dg1f1f><size=42>那代价，会是你所珍视的一切？</color></i></size>","style":14,"background":10002,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"？？？","content":"……我…………","voice":["vo_event_403702201_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37022","style":1,"background":10002,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"少女睁开眼。","style":3,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"阳光从宽阔的窗口洒落，将房间一分为二，划为两半。","style":3,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"她正站在操作台旁。液态金属在她面前安静地流动，逐渐分离、聚合、重组，最终形成一条嵌合的螺旋。","style":3,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"随着她的动作，这段螺旋继续伸展，组合出一种精密且优美的结构。细密的金属层层搭建，反射出点点亮光。","style":3,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"content":"【空1s，响起通讯石音效《-这个音效想找一个类似黑石英那种，不用电子音】","style":18,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"金属的生长停止了。少女看向房间另一侧的通讯仪，深深呼吸，然后接通。","style":3,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"？？？","content":"第8次定期汇报。","voice":["vo_event_403701001_01"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37010","style":1,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"？？？","content":"最新的屏蔽仪器即将投入使用，目前材料损耗仍高于预期，需要继续采集数据，完成最终优化。但……","voice":["vo_event_403701001_03"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37010","style":1,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"content":"少女深深吸气，手指慢慢攥紧，指尖嵌入掌心。光线从落地的玻璃窗中照进来，但却照不到她所在的位置。","style":3,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"？？？","content":"关于城外的灾害……<color=#fb9259>它</color>的异动越来越频繁了。","voice":["vo_event_403701001_05"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37010","style":1,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"？？？","content":"狄斯还在限制异方晶出口，现在城内出现了很多伤员。我们的设备与物资不足以与它长期对抗，如果能获得家族的支援，进度肯定会更有保障。况且狄斯那边——","voice":["vo_event_403701001_06"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37010","style":1,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"严肃的声音","content":"伊帕希娅。","voice":["vo_event_403701001_07"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37010","style":11,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"content":"少女被打断。她抬起头，前方通讯仪的顶端闪着冰冷的光。","style":3,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"speaker":"严肃的声音","content":"做你该做的就好。别忘了，我们研究秘金的真正目的是什么。","voice":["vo_event_403701001_09"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37010","style":11,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"speaker":"伊帕希娅","content":"……是，我明白了。","voice":["vo_event_403701001_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37010","style":1,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"content":"通讯晶石又闪动几下，彻底熄灭。房间安静下来，只剩少女压抑的呼吸声。","style":3,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"speaker":"伊帕希娅","content":"……","voice":["vo_event_403701001_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37010","style":1,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"content":"仍待调整的金属被搁置在操作台上。伊帕希娅走到窗边，视线扫过下方的城镇，投向远方逐渐逼近的漆黑风暴。","style":3,"background":2389,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"content":"黑沙漫天，狂厄在风中呼啸，将所有被卷入的存在吞噬殆尽。它盘踞在高空，就宛若一张永不撤离的混沌幕布。","style":3,"background":2004,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"content":"但——","style":3,"background":2004,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"content":"突然，黑暗中出现了一个不合群的亮点。","style":3,"background":2004,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"speaker":"伊帕希娅","content":"？那是……","voice":["vo_event_403701001_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37010","style":1,"background":2004,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"content":"在风暴的中心，那个小小的光点越来越明显，越来越近，然后——","style":3,"background":2004,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"content":"【震动+白屏】【背景-砂海风暴】","style":18,"background":2004,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"content":"砰！一辆破破烂烂的车子冲出风暴，随之而来的是一阵尖叫。紧紧追赶在车子后方的少女呲牙咧嘴，惊声尖叫。","style":3,"background":2004,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"speaker":"海拉","content":"等等、等我一下，我还没上车啊啊啊啊啊啊——！","voice":["vo_event_403701001_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_37010","style":1,"background":2004,"log_type":1}]}